preferences-pane-title = BibTeX Clean
preferences-delete-title = Filter and delete
preferences-delete-description = "Filter and delete children" moves the selected child items to the trash, deleting them in batches of the size below. There is no in-plugin undo for deletions; the Zotero trash is the way back.
preferences-delete-concurrency = Delete concurrency
preferences-delete-concurrency-hint = 1 deletes one item at a time; higher values are faster but write in larger bursts.
